The '''Lapis Quarry''' is the second floor of the [[Deep Caverns]].

{{ZoneText|The &bLapis Quarry&f can now be traveled to via the Lift Operator.|Mine Lapis Lazuli Ore.|Talk to the Lapis Miner.|Watch out for Lapis Zombies!}}

== Features ==
The '''Lapis Quarry''' features a few attractions.

=== Lift Operator ===
{{Main|Lift Operator}}
In front of the lift shaft is the {{NPCSprite|Lift Operator}}, who allows players to teleport between layers of the [[Deep Caverns]] with ease. Once the player has entered the '''Lapis Quarry''' and talked to the [[Lift Operator]], they will be able to teleport to the floor from any other level of the island.

=== Lapis Miner ===
{{Main|Lapis Miner}}
At the back of the small rounded cave at the far end of the '''Lapis Quarry''', the {{NPCSprite|Lapis Miner}} can be found. They are an [[NPC]] who asks the player to bring them a {{Item|Lapis Pickaxe}}, which requires reaching {{Coll|Lapis Lazuli III}} to craft. Upon giving them one, they award the player with a {{Item|Compactor}} and {{SBXP}}.

